{"title":"An Unpaid Toll","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">Footpads southeast of Binxonia are charging travelers to use a road they do not own.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/bram-fen\">Bram Fen</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"bram-fen\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>9</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><p>Nothing to bring.</p></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/bram-fen\">Bram Fen</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Imp Tree)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"31|48|Bram Fen\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Find the footpad camp southeast of Binxonia. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map q-map-btn\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"176|110|Footpad camp\">📍 Footpad camp</button></li><li value=\"3\">Kill <b>10</b> <a href=\"#/monster/footpad\">footpads</a> there.</li><li value=\"4\">Report their defeat to <a href=\"#/npc/bram-fen\">Bram Fen</a> to finish the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map q-map-btn\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"31|48|Bram Fen\">📍 Bram Fen</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>220</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>7,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Bram Fen says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Bram Fen:</b> The next carter came through with his purse still tied. That&#39;s the report I wanted.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"The next carter came through with his purse still tied. That&#39;s the report I wanted.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>An Unpaid Toll</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-an-unpaid-toll\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-an-unpaid-toll\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-an-unpaid-toll\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-an-unpaid-toll\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-an-unpaid-toll\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Bram Fen says</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-an-unpaid-toll\" data-g-jump=\"g-end\">Handing it in</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}